          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Otter and Beaver: Fall Stories is a cozy collection of heartwarming audio stories filled with all the simple joys of autumn. Follow thoughtful, careful Beaver and playful, energetic Otter as they jump into leaf piles, search for the perfect pumpkin, carve silly-spooky jack-o’-lanterns, gather harvest treats, share not-so-scary campfire stories, knit cozy sweaters, bake pumpkin pie, and celebrate a thankful feast with friends.Each story celebrates familiar fall traditions while gently highlighting friendship, teamwork, patience, gratitude, and finding joy in everyday moments. With calm pacing, simple language, and soft, cozy sound design, these stories are perfect for quiet time, car rides, rest time, or winding down before bed.Children will love Otter’s playful imagination and Beaver’s thoughtful plans, while parents will appreciate the comforting atmosphere and positive messages woven naturally into every adventure. These cozy autumn stories are made to be enjoyed again and again throughout the fall season.Run Time: 32 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: f0c1d578e96c6e0cc5318f6bec9216fae6b2a9917f11b098f8643e5d6a5dba5e",
